WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.643
Clone the Scry sample app, scry-sample-rn, a small coffee-order app called Kettle.

2
00:00:07.693 --> 00:00:13.712
Run npm install, then npm run android, or npm run ios on a Mac.

3
00:00:13.762 --> 00:00:17.815
The app opens on the Kettle Menu screen.

4
00:00:17.865 --> 00:00:24.960
The same code holds 21 Storybook stories, and those are what Scry captures.

